{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22008","headline":"赠友五首 四 · 白居易","name":"赠友五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京师四方则，王化之本根。\n长吏久於政，然後风教敦。\n如何尹京者，迁次不逡巡。\n请君屈指数，十年十五人。\n科条日相矫，吏力亦已勤。\n宽猛政不一，民心安得淳。\n九州雍爲首，羣牧之所遵。\n天下率如此，何以安吾民。\n谁能变此法，待君赞弥纶。\n慎择循良吏，令其长子孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}